      "field": "description",
      "before": "Product Description\nRedefine your festive presence with this Sunburst Yellow Silk Set. Crafted from rich, premium silk fabric, this refined outfit features a long, above-knee cream-yellow kurta, classic cream silk Aligarhi-style bottoms, and a statement Bandi jacket showcasing energetic chevron and Leheriya stripes in yellow, turquoise, and coral. Accentuated with delicate white floral embroidery framing the jacket border, a sharp Bandgala collar with multi-tone stitch detailing, and contrasting pink buttons along the kurta placket, this ensemble strikes a flawless balance between celebratory color and modern tailoring. Whether attending haldi ceremonies, daytime pujas, or festive family gatherings, this outfit guarantees a vibrant, royal presence.\nKey Features\n3-Piece Complete Set\nPremium Silk Fabric with Cream Silk Aligarhi Bottoms\nYellow, Turquoise & Coral Leheriya Print\nFloral Thread Embroidery\nClassic Bandhgala Collar with Multi-Color Stitching\nContrast Pink Button Detailing\nIdeal for Haldi, Daytime Functions & Festive Celebrations\nStyling Tips\nFootwear: Complete your look by pairing this ensemble with our Handcrafted Embroidered Juttis for a traditional aesthetic, or our Classic Leather Sandals for a sleek, breathable finish.\nAccessories: Enhance the look with an antique gold or silver-toned watch, regal metallic cuff studs, and a statement ring featuring traditional stone setting to complement the fine threadwork.\nStyling: Wear the full 3-piece set for main daytime ceremonies and haldi festivities, or pair the cream-yellow kurta and cream Aligarhi bottoms solo for a light, effortless celebration look.",
      "after": "Yellow Silk Kurta, Multi-Tone Chevron & Embroidered Bandi Jacket & Cream Aligarhi for Men. This 3-piece set includes: Kurta, Jacket, and Aligarhi. Fabric: Silk. Composition percentages are not stated. Colour: Yellow, bottoms in Cream. Design: Bandhgala, button closure, embroidery and printed. Fit type is not stated. Sizes 38–50 are chest sizes in inches: pick your chest measurement, as fitting ease is already included. Garment chest runs 42–54 in, shoulder 18–23 in. The model is listed as 6ft and wearing size 40 (merchant to confirm for this shoot). In stock at capture: 38, 40, 42, 44, 46, 48, 50 (of 38, 40, 42, 44, 46, 48, 50). Care: dry clean only. Listed occasions: Reception and Office Party Wear. Price: ₹ 28,656 MRP, inclusive of all taxes.",
